message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."

title: "BLOCKS: an application for administering blocked, text-based factorial vignette studies"
type: software
version: 2.0.0

authors:
  - family-names: Lomholt
    given-names: Rune
    affiliation: University College Copenhagen
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5333-3234"

year: 2026

abstract: >
  BLOCKS is an open-source FastAPI application for administering blocked, 
  text-based factorial vignette studies. Version 2.0.0 introduces modular 
  application architecture, concurrency-safe quota allocation, resumable 
  participation, lifecycle tracking, server-side validation, expanded 
  paradata, protected episode-level export, database monitoring, database 
  migrations, automated tests, and a staged R design workflow. Outcome 
  variables and response scales remain configurable through structured 
  Excel workbooks.

repository-code: "https://github.com/runehlomholt/BLOCKS"
